2026-06-04	daily	benzinga	complete	### 🗓 June 4, 2026 — Pre-Market Brief\n\n**One-liner**: AVGO -15% after reiterating (not raising) its $100B+ FY2027 AI revenue target despite record Q2 results; CRWD -10% post beat-and-raise + 4-for-1 split; MRVL +7% extending its +53% 5-day run on Jensen Huang's "next trillion-dollar company" endorsement; PVH -21% on weak guidance; initial claims 225K vs 214K est.\n\n---\n\n### ⚡ Top Movers At a Glance\n\n| Ticker | Move | Cap | Catalyst | Theme |\n|--------|------|-----|----------|-------|\n| AVGO | -15% | Mega | Q2 rev $22.19B miss $22.27B est; AI semi guide $16B vs $16.4B est; FY27 AI >$100B reiterated not raised | AI Compute / Custom Silicon |\n| CRWD | -10% | Mega | Q1 EPS $1.10 beat $1.07; rev $1.39B beat $1.36B; 4-for-1 split; FY27 guide raised | Cybersecurity |\n| MRVL | +7.2% | Mega | Continuation of +53% 5D rally; Huang "next trillion-dollar company" at Computex | AI Compute / Networking |\n| DELL | -5.4% | Mega | Profit-taking after +34% 5D; no new catalyst | AI Servers |\n| NOW | -6.3% | Mega | Profit-taking after +17% 5D software rally | SaaS |\n| INTC | +4.5% | Mega | Premarket bounce; 3nm/18A supply expansion comments; Computex positioning | Semiconductors |\n| META | +3.4% | Mega | AI Business Agent expansion; paid subscription plans coming | Social / AI |\n| WMT | +3.4% | Mega | BTIG reiterated Buy $145 PT; AI offline shopping data advantage reported | Retail |\n| PVH | -21% | Large | Q1 EPS $2.01 beat $1.87 but Q4 EPS guide below est; Evercore d/g to In-Line | Apparel / Retail |\n| HPE | -1.5% | Large | Consolidating after +48% 5D; 15 analyst PT raises (avg ~$69, BofA to $80) | AI Servers |\n| CRWV | -6.3% | Large | Profit-taking after first Nvidia Vera Rubin NVL72 deployment; BNP initiates OP $192 | AI Cloud |\n| NTSK | -19% | Large | Q1 rev $202M beat $198M; CFO retirement announced; billings outlook cautious | Cybersecurity / SaaS |\n| MDT | +4.8% | Large | Q4 rev $9.81B beat $9.64B; FY27 EPS guide $5.90-$6.00