8	0	2026-10-04	Core Holdings	NETFLIX be like Netflix because it is extremely undervalued. It is a blue chip at the end of the day and even if things do not work out, there is safety in all of that cash flow so I think we are going to sit tight I think we should not try to exceed 25% of the entire ammo.\n\nNike is again extremely undervalued but really poorly executing. It is almost like we want to take a flyer because the brand value should materialize once they fix their execution. I think we have about 2500 shares. We want to get it up to 150 K total so maybe we can buy 2500 shares more potentially around $30 so maybe we should set the alert\nPlease\n\nGITLAB preeti is that get hub keeps going down because it cannot handle the volume of comments made by these agents so we are in this new paradigm and that is an understatement of how much code is going to get committed how much CIC and all that good stuff so it stands to benefit and that is why it is expensive, but obviously there are execution risks, new emergence technologies that might disrupt but all things considered. It's a small enough unit small enough market cap so we just gotta add it hopefully at a cheaper price. So now I think we are in good value place we potentially do not want to exceed that we should look for another similar sized cool holding we like get lab because it is small enough. It is a little bit more valued and can easily have or become half I should say if things become if things don't so maybe we want to buy it on extreme pullbacks and then just be there for that to become a complete zero so you probably do not want to exceed 100 K on that.\n\nBofA flagged AI-agent disruption risk for ASANA, MNDY, BL, DBX, HUBS, INTU, PAYC, PCTY, ZM from Meta's Muse and OpenAI's Dots.	\N	2026-10-04 10:12:17.084329-04	2026-10-05 08:52:49.113475-04
