verage with Buy/Outperform ratings and ~$25–34 PTs, framing WhiteFiber as a pure‑play AI/HPC infrastructure winner with a differentiated retrofit model (late April–early May 2026)", "WhiteFiber announces long‑term AI colocation agreement with Nscale Global for 40MW at NC‑1, with total contract value disclosed around $865M over 10 years and 3% annual escalators, validating demand and de‑risking growth capex (2026-05-08)", "Upcoming Q1 2026 earnings call and first clean post‑IPO quarterly print following full‑year 2025 results, with expectations for continued AI cloud growth (press release scheduling the call on 2026‑05‑14; prior Q4 2025 revenues beat consensus at ~$23.6M vs $23.1M but EPS missed by a wide margin, 2026-03-26)", "Market narrative and media/analyst commentary highlighting WhiteFiber as a niche AI/HPC infrastructure provider benefiting from surging demand for GPU‑rich capacity, with consensus models calling for strong multi‑year revenue growth from cloud services and data center segments (S&P Global/Visible Alpha preview note, 2026-03-2026)", "Craig-Hallum initiates WhiteFiber (WYFI) with Buy and $25 PT, highlighting differentiated AI data center retrofit model and strong margins (2026-04-21)", "Multiple additional initiations with Buy/Outperform ratings and $25–34 targets from Roth/MKM, Needham, Clear Street, Macquarie and B. Riley, all emphasizing AI data center growth and attractive valuation (late April–early May 2026)", "WhiteFiber announces ~$865M, 10‑year AI data center colocation agreement with Nscale Global for 40MW at its NC‑1 campus, with phased deployments starting 2026 and 3% annual escalators (2026-05-08)"], "momentum_factors": {"rsi_mktcap": {"points": 15, "reason": "rsi_mktcap=98"}, "vol_vs_avg": {"points": 10, "reason": "vol 2.51x"}, "dr5_atr_norm": {"points": 10.01, "reason": "dr5=33.6% atr=10.0% norm=1.50"}, "multi_screen": {"points": 0.0, "reason": "1 screen"}, "recent_event": {"points": 20, "reason": "event 2d ago"}, "trend_alignment