r or major regulatory breakthrough behind the move, so this is mostly a story-stock / execution-re-rating trade.", "current_price": 3.215, "matched_themes": ["story-driven-momentum", "special-situations-with-optional-downside", "breakout-and-new-highs"], "momentum_score": 76.34, "verdict_claude": "WATCH", "composite_score": 60.54, "last_event_date": "2026-05-22", "last_event_type": "volume_spike", "news_theme_tags": ["story-driven-momentum", "breakout-and-new-highs", "special-situations-with-optional-downside", "short-covering-in-underowned-cyclicals"], "headline_drivers": ["Virgin Galactic reported Q1 2026 results on 2026-05-13 with revenue of about $0.31M and EPS of -$0.98, beating the loss estimate of -$1.12; management also cited continued cost control with non-GAAP operating expenses down 16% YoY in Q3 2025 and a commercial ramp tied to Delta-class vehicles / Q4 2026 launch timing.", "Analyst sentiment has been turning more constructive in May 2026: Susquehanna raised its target from $2.50 to $3.00 and Jefferies maintained Buy with a $5.00 target, while market commentary points to a 2027 revenue ramp toward $1.3B-$1.7B if the commercial launch executes.", "The stock is also getting a short-term technical/flow boost after a 3.81x volume spike on 2026-05-22, with the name appearing on top-1d / volspike-gapper screens and trading in a high-momentum setup rather than on a single new customer contract."], "momentum_factors": {"rsi_mktcap": {"points": 15, "reason": "rsi_mktcap=96"}, "vol_vs_avg": {"points": 10, "reason": "vol 3.61x"}, "dr5_atr_norm": {"points": 4.34, "reason": "dr5=14.4% atr=9.9% norm=0.65"}, "multi_screen": {"points": 12.0, "reason": "2 screens"}, "recent_event": {"points": 20, "reason": "event 1d ago"}, "trend_alignment": {"points": 15, "reason": "both up (20d=24.6, 60d=21.8)"}}, "news_materiality": 2, "theme_fit_reason": "This is mainly a story-stock execution trade: the market is pricing in a future commercialization ramp rather than a current bu