ate is **Nov. 11, 2026**. [finance.yahoo](https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CYPH/)\n\n---\n\n## 1. Summary\n\nCypherpunk Technologies (NASDAQ: CYPH) is a privacy-technology company built around a Zcash (ZEC) digital-asset treasury and Zcash mining operation; it was formerly Leap Therapeutics. Its current verticals are ZEC accumulation, U.S.-based Zcash mining through Cypherpunk Mining, and investments or acquisitions in privacy-enhancing technologies, including the ZODL wallet ecosystem. [finance.yahoo](https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CYPH/)\n\n## 2. Why the stock is moving\n\nCYPH has surged from roughly $0.71 on August 17 to about $4.12 on September 25 as investors price it as a leveraged public-market Zcash vehicle amid strong crypto momentum.  The company’s August 18 launch of the world’s largest Zcash mining fleet—and the September 22 disclosure that the fleet generated 3,023.13 ZEC in its first two weeks—turned the story from a passive ZEC treasury into an operating miner accumulating additional ZEC. [investors.leaptx](https://investors.leaptx.com/news-releases/news-release-details/cypherpunk-technologies-launches-worlds-largest-zcash-mining)\n\n## 3. Drivers\n\n- Aug. 18, 2026 — CEO Douglas Onsi launched Cypherpunk Mining through a $33.33 million Winklevoss Capital transaction, deploying 4.2 GSol/s of Zcash hashrate, about 18% of the network → established the world’s largest Zcash mining fleet. [investors.leaptx](https://investors.leaptx.com/news-releases/news-release-details/cypherpunk-technologies-launches-worlds-largest-zcash-mining)\n- Sep. 22, 2026 — Cypherpunk appointed mining executive Amanda Fabiano to the board and disclosed 3,023.13 ZEC mined from Aug. 18–31, all added to treasury → confirmed early mining execution. [stocktitan](https://www.stocktitan.net/sec-filings/CYPH/8-k-cypherpunk-technologies-inc-reports-material-event-92bb7b6009bf.html)\n- Aug. 11, 2026 — Cypherpunk reported 323,394.38 ZEC held, equal to about 1.92% of circulating ZEC, at a $341.83 average purchase price → high direct sensitivity to ZEC price moves. [sec](https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1509745/000110465926094449/cyph-20260630x10q.htm)\n- Aug. 18, 2026 — Cypherpunk issued Winklevoss Treasury Investments a pre-funded warrant for 43,290,042 shares at a $0.001 exercise price to fund the mining acquisition → funded mining scale but created substantial dilution exposure. [stocktitan](https://www.stocktitan.net/sec-filings/CYPH/8-k-cypherpunk-technologies-inc-reports-material-event-dad8396bb906.html)\n- Sep. 10, 2026 — Cantor Fitzgerald raised its CYPH price target to $4.90 from $1.60 and retained Overweight → external validation accelerated momentum. [cnbc](https://www.cnbc.com/quotes/CYPH)\n- Sep. 25, 2026 — CYPH closed at $4.12, up 0.98% on the day after trading above $3.90 intraday earlier in the week → momentum held following the mining update. [barchart](https://www.barchart.com/stocks/quotes/CYPH)	2026-09-26 22:30:25.610116-04	2026-10-04 14:28:29.391404-04
